   "section": "Exterior",
   "text": "There are scratches around the vehicle. Normal for mileage and most too small to see in photos. Dent observed on the driver-side roof rail pic 16. The paint shows some wear and tear that is consistent with age and mileage. The underside shows areas of surface rust. See pictures."
  },
  {
   "section": "Interior",
   "text": "There is wear to the seats. Normal for mileage. The inner door panels show wear consistent with age and mileage. The interior trim shows wear consistent with age and mileage. I noted no smoke or odd odors. The interior electronics and climate controls worked. The windows, locks, and mirrors all functioned. The gauges worked."
  },
  {
   "section": "Mechanical",
   "text": "Exhaust shows some surface rust. Only one key fob was shown during inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Test Drive",
   "text": "I noted good acceleration. The transmission worked as designed. The vehicle handled and braked well. I noted no odd noises or vibrations. No DTC faulty codes found during inspection."
  },
  {
   "section": "Note:",
   "text": "Aftermarket modifications were noted, including tires, bed cover, side steps, window tint, and an OBD piggyback device that appears to function as a GPS tracker. The OBD device does not appear to be a tuner, power adder, or performance modifier."
